    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "State lives in two places",
      "items": [
        "SQLite is per-laptop: rows, leases, attempts, spend",
        "The ticket AI State field is the only shared state",
        "In-flight remotely with no local row means orphan — never adopt"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Nothing leaves unredacted",
      "items": [
        "redact() scrubs every comment, error and agent event log",
        "Exact injected token values are matched, not only shapes",
        "Agent runs use dontAsk with an explicit tool allowlist"
